    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0113_14783ef552da.png\" style=\"width: 192px; height: 153px;\" /></p><p>Distance = Area of |v| &ndash; t graph&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
